// Bitbucket User Details Export Attempt Detected | T1082, T1213, T1591.004 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/application/bitbucket/audit/bitbucket_audit_user_details_export_attempt_detected.yml
auditType.category:"Users and groups" AND (auditType.action:("User permissions export failed" OR "User permissions export started" OR "User permissions exported"))
